FAIL [acknowledged_notification_rearms_the_next_physical_write] the post-acknowledge signal re-arms the physical write
FAIL [coalesced_signals_are_consumed_and_the_next_signal_writes] a signal after the coalesced acknowledgement re-arms the write
FAIL [stale_acknowledgement_cannot_suppress_the_next_wake] the post-acknowledge signal re-arms the physical write
RUN_EXIT=1
